What is the output of the following validated setter program?
```java
class AccountTier {
    private int tier = 1;
    public void setTier(int t) {
        if (t >= 1 && t <= 3) {
            this.tier = t;
        }
    }
    public int getTier() {
        return tier;
    }
}
public class TierApp {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        AccountTier at = new AccountTier();
        at.setTier(2);
        at.setTier(9);
        System.out.println(at.getTier());
    }
}
```

