What is the output of the following defensive copy getter demonstration?
```java
class ScoreRegister {
    private int[] scores = {90, 80};
    public int[] getScores() {
        return scores.clone(); // defensive copy
    }
}
public class ScoreApp {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        ScoreRegister sr = new ScoreRegister();
        int[] copy = sr.getScores();
        copy[0] = 10;
        System.out.println(sr.getScores()[0]);
    }
}
```

